"working.geometry":["BRIEF.md:3 fixes four horizontal frames in16x16 cells; renderer/view.mjs:30-38 requires64x16. Source leaves construction method open.","64x16/four16x16/no gaps preserve consumer geometry. 'without resizing' additionally binds the specialist's lossless assembly route, not universal owner art policy.","A coherent native16x16 set assembled without resampling passes. A visually readable image downsampled from32x32 could meet visual meaning but fails this deliberately lossless chosen route; do not promote this to owner rule.","Keep as scoped preparation/assembly process choice; mechanical geometry review only."],
"working.appearance":["BRIEF.md:3 requires readable activity rather than success, transparency,cool blue,1x/3x. Scoped style decision:113-124 adds deliberate clusters/stepped treatment and expressly leaves palette/alpha/stroke/margins open.","All clauses preserve source outcomes. 'never reads as successful completion' implements activity-not-success rather than banning any incidental diagonal. Cluster treatment comes from adopted style, not measured cluster count.","A readable pale-blue loop with partial alpha, different margins and more/fewer than3segments remains allowed. A success check that animates still violates activity-not-success. A different cluster count is not rejected.","Keep exact visual route and qualitative criterion; no new visual verdict."],
"working.motion":["BRIEF.md:3 requires four100ms looping activity frames. AUTHORING-STAGE requires exact assembly policy; prior repaired animation review reports actual morph/holds and jump.","Stable placement/coherent shape/volume and no unintended holds/morphing are expert quality checks motivated by observed failure. 'unintended' does not ban designed pulsation or intentional deformation. Exact quarter-turns are absent from this rejection rule.","A coherent pulse with intentionally varying volume could pass the literal condition; the provider's quarter-turn recipe is a proposal. An accidental long hold with popping segment loss fails expert continuity quality even if timing metadata is100ms.","Keep scoped expert motion quality; assess actual playback separately. Superseded as complete current contract by reduced-motion update."],
"working.destination":["src/queue.ts:1-4 started->running; queue-view.ts:4,9-11 maps Working path,four frames,100ms,both consumers. renderer/view.mjs:30-38 supplies cropping.","All controls/paths match consumer. Stable recorded placement is destination verification supported by prior mismatch recovery, not a mandate on glyph margins.","A correct PNG with wrong runtime source rectangle or a screenshot taken after layout drift fails destination review despite standalone readability. A changed pivot/margin with correct consumer placement is not prohibited.","Keep live route and both-consumer checks; add future reduced-motion branch coverage before new request."],
"retry.geometry":["BRIEF.md:3 specifies static Retry,16x16cells; queue-view.ts:7 maps1frame.","Literal one static16x16 frame adds no construction/motif restriction.","A16x16 circular arrow or other readable retry symbol passes geometry; a64x16sheet or animated Retry fails source static contract.","Keep local measurement."],
"retry.appearance":["BRIEF.md:3 requires non-color retry distinction/readability/transparency/cool blue. Scoped style:113-124 applies.","Failure/retry meaning, distinction, transparent exterior and adopted pixel treatment match; no arrowhead, palette count,binary alpha or observed cluster count imposed.","A readable alternate failure/retry silhouette with partial alpha can pass. Merely recoloring the Ready check fails non-color distinction.","Keep visual route. Compare against retained available family as member context; new collective check remains separately scheduled."],
"retry.destination":["queue.ts:2-3 error->failed; queue-view.ts:7,9-11 Retry/error-retry.png,one frame,both consumers; renderer:30-38.","Static behavior,label,path,sampling/compositing and recorded placement match sources and destination obligation.","An excellent retry image loaded from stale assets/retry.png fails actual current consumer path. Different shape allowed if meaning/style satisfied.","Keep live consumer verification."],
"paused.geometry":["BRIEF.md:7 introduces paused within existing cell/display contract; queue-view.ts:5 oneframe.","One static16x16 frame matches source descriptor; no pause-bar recipe added.","A distinct static pause motif other than two bars passes geometry. A multi-frame pause sheet fails current descriptor.","Keep local measurement."],
"paused.appearance":["BRIEF.md:7: 'distinguishable from activity, completion and retry without relying on color alone'; scoped style:113-124.","Literal check preserves all three comparisons and style. No exact two bars, palette,binary alpha or footprint mandate.","A readable stationary pause sign distinct in silhouette can pass even if not conventional bars. A differently colored Working motif would fail non-color distinction.","Keep visual route; retained existing members provide available context, new family comparison remains delivery obligation. Stationary Working update requires renewed comparison later."],
"paused.destination":["queue.ts:2-3 pause->paused; queue-view.ts:5,9-11 Paused/assets/paused.png/static,both consumers; renderer:30-38.","Paths,label,static behavior and display conditions match, no additional motif rule.","A correct image reached only in full but not compact consumer fails both-consumer source obligation.","Keep live route."],
"delivery.continuity":["AUTHORING-STAGE:connected Working/Retry/Paused plus Ready collective delivery; BRIEF.md:3,7; scoped style decision:113-124.","Compares ordered exact members and Working playback while excluding unsupported numerical/color/alpha constraints. 'readable weight' is coherent readability, no equal area or stroke count.","Paused bars may be visibly heavier than Ready and still pass qualitative consistency. Exact palette mismatch alone cannot reject. A matte tile or incompatible treatment fails qualitative style.","Keep visual continuity separate from member checks; all prospective producers remain required."],
"delivery.distinction":["BRIEF.md:3 activity not success and error/retry non-color; :7 Paused distinct from all three; :3 preserve Start.","Color/grayscale comparison is expert verification route for non-color requirement, not requirement to deliver grayscale art; keeps all states and Start.","A family distinguishable by silhouette with shared identical colors passes; recolored copies of one silhouette fail. Start unchanged bytes remain separate preservation evidence.","Keep collective visual route. Current update adds stationary Working comparison, absent from old plan, so no adoption as current."],
"delivery.destination":["AUTHORING-STAGE preserves actual slicing/timing,both responsibilities,Start; queue.ts:1-4 and queue-view.ts:2-11 enumerate exact states/paths.","All five transitions,static/animation mapping and display behavior match. Includes exact retained delivery files and prior recorded placement obligation.","Files copied correctly but not exercised in compact consumer fail. A valid new file silently replacing original accepted package is outside assigned prospective scope.","Keep live collective review; current reduced-motion mapping unresolved and no delivery acceptance assigned."]
};
store("comparisons",plan.stages.flatMap(s=>s.criteria.map(c=>({id:`${plan.id}.${s.id}.q.${c.id}`,literal_check:c.check,route:{domain:c.domain,mode:c.mode},source_obligation:compares[`${s.id}.${c.id}`][0],literal_delta:compares[`${s.id}.${c.id}`][1],discriminating_alternative:compares[`${s.id}.${c.id}`][2],disposition:compares[`${s.id}.${c.id}`][3]}))).concat(plan.delivery.criteria.map(c=>({id:`${plan.id}.delivery.q.${c.id}`,literal_check:c.check,route:{domain:c.domain,mode:c.mode},source_obligation:compares[`delivery.${c.id}`][0],literal_delta:compares[`delivery.${c.id}`][1],discriminating_alternative:compares[`delivery.${c.id}`][2],disposition:compares[`delivery.${c.id}`][3]}))));
text({criteria:load("comparisons").length});

