.family.01.paused.output"],destination_choice:"render.choice.destination",adoption:"render.decision.style",contracts:"Read actual Working/Retry/Paused C records: full alpha, empty fixed palette, correct native geometry, qualitative adopted style. No new measured color/cluster constraints.",dependencies:"Working needs existing accepted seed output; static stages use adopted Ready baseline; delivery depends on each prospective producer plus Ready. No invented candidate and no prerequisite requires completed collective delivery before member acceptance.",selection:"Each final stage bound once to its authoring-plar asset; original plar remains unchanged."},provider_comparison:{provider:"pixellab-official-mcp",tool:"animate_image",official_declaration:"mcp__pixellab__animate_image in official-discovery.json",arguments_exactly_match_durable_job:true,input_field:"first_frame_base64",input_sha256:"21f5baca68958eaa30d89fe9ec216e2b8dfc9e4a941f80b8a19fa0e712939629",input_bytes_equal_original_seed:true,input_size:[16,16],base64_strictly_decoded:true,schema_validated:true,controls:{frame_count:4,no_background:true,seed:110901},declaration_semantics:"Even frame count4 is supported;16x16 is below256x256 and total16*16*4=1024 below524288. No invented style_image or timing parameter. Ready guides prior accepted seed and later review; Ready itself is not a transmitted second image.",frame_policy:"Retain input0 plus generated1..4; assemble1..4 at x0,16,32,48,y0 into64x16 with100ms consumer playback. No unreviewed substitution/drop/duplication/resizing. Separate per-frame, visual, playback and both-consumer review remain unperformed.",method_assessment:"Supported bounded motion experiment, low confidence: prior AI animation failed matte then morph/holds; deterministic seed quarter-turn construction succeeded. Prompt quarter-turn/center preservation are expert choices only and no improved quality is claimed. Future deterministic route needs discovered supported scene contract. No new generation authorized."},update_comparison:{original_requirements_hash:"e0614bd962a53a19003707f3d73326be436891e198eb1e4a262f12412fbfb027",observed_requirements_hash:"2901c7107d4f162e98653140ea8061dfe213821b22a5e1338d9d2d6de5b4ad0c",reconciled_requirements_hash:fw.requirements_hash,source:"AUTHORING-UPDATE.md:2-10",finding:"New stationary reduced-motion Working symbol must be distinct from Ready and Paused. Existing source descriptor maps running only to assets/working.png frames4; both consumers accept state only. paint uses timed modulo; live renderer continuously advances without a motion-preference route.",minimum_next_review:"Define motion-preference input, fixed-frame versus separate static destination/descriptor, mapping in BOTH consumers, preference-aware live renderer and tests for stationary activity distinct from Ready/Paused. A standalone16x16 file at current64x16-required path would fail geometry guard. Preserve normal-mode100ms loop unless later source review changes it.",adoption:"Old plan/request retained as history, not current reduced-motion contract. Old seed pose acceptance does not accept stationary use.",current_blockers:fw.production.jobs.find(x=>x.id===j.id).blockers},request_review_tool:{diagnostics:load("caller_report").diagnostics,locator_errors:[],meaning:"Caller independently interpreted sources; tool's resolved locators and hash validity are not semantic/visual acceptance."},preservation:{...load("preservation"),original_state_records:376,original_state_records_changed:0,original_state_records_removed:0,current_state_records:405,original_plar_sha256:"a462ecf3b6b45c0382d3483b0f4f6912a9d0bd1d68e75253143faa1423837344"},next:"Keep prepared intent blocked. Resolve stationary consumer/contract mapping and retained prepared intent before any separately assigned revised plan/request; no remote action or asset acceptance."};
store("caller_review",review);
