      "id": "authoring.queue.family.01.working.q.appearance",
      "literal_check": "Inspect each actual frame at 1x and 3x nearest on #172336 against exact ready.retained baseline: readable activity silhouette that never reads as successful completion, transparent exterior without unintended matte/fringe, perceptible cool-blue accent, deliberate coherent clusters and stepped edges. No fixed palette, binary alpha, exact stroke, margins or reference cluster count is required.",
