        "domain": "visual",
        "mode": "visual"
      },
      "source_obligation": "BRIEF.md:3 requires readable activity rather than success, transparency,cool blue,1x/3x. Scoped style decision:113-124 adds deliberate clusters/stepped treatment and expressly leaves palette/alpha/stroke/margins open.",
      "literal_delta": "All clauses preserve source outcomes. 'never reads as successful completion' implements activity-not-success rather than banning any incidental diagonal. Cluster treatment comes from adopted style, not measured cluster count.",
      "discriminating_alternative": "A readable pale-blue loop with partial alpha, different margins and more/fewer than3segments remains allowed. A success check that animates still violates activity-not-success. A different cluster count is not rejected.",
